  "_comment": "What each trader sells for money (buy), by trader id (data/traders/traders.json). Mole, the fence, has nothing here: his used gear is rolled each restock (data/config/trading.json, used_stock). A buy offer: id (stable and unique among every offer and barter: saves keep how many were bought this restock under it), item, count, price, currency (RUB or USD), ll and stock. \"ll\": the loyalty level with that trader an offer needs (1 if left out); at least the level its item's rarity needs (min_loyalty in data/config/trading.json: Rare LL2, Ultra Rare LL3, Epic LL4, Legendary never for money): cheap rounds at LL1, soft and tracer rounds at LL2, AP rounds at LL3-4; the best AP rounds aren't sold (loot, the Workbench and LL4 barters). \"stock\": how many you can buy each restock (left out: no limit); given to the rare and strong offers (Rare and better guns, armor class 4 and up, AP ammo packs, stims, the best scopes, visors and headsets). Barters are in data/traders/barters/ (BarterTable). Nothing bought is ever found in raid.",
